@startuml
!theme cyborg
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam defaultFontColor #F3F4F6
title Proposed — Draft, preview and immutable publication dimensions
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

state "Editable draft" as D
state "Exact preview observation\nnot a committed live state" as P
state "Immutable publication revision" as R
state "Live selection / visibility\nseparate owner-controlled pointer and eligibility" as L
state "Retired content\nonly under reviewed lifecycle policy" as T
[*] --> D
D --> D : explicit edit / selected apply / save
D --> P : preview exact version, read-only
P --> D : continue editing; old preview becomes stale
P --> R : separate confirmation + current guards + protected references
R --> L : guarded live selection update
R --> R : later edits do not redefine revision identity
L --> T : eligible retirement / withdrawal per actual policy
note bottom of T
 Unpublish/withdraw is not revision deletion.
 Draft, live eligibility, artifact availability and actual submission are distinct.
 No retention period or new unpublish endpoint is allocated here.
end note

@enduml